  "text": ">\nLocation:\nDarkon Ultra Merge\n-\nUltra Darkon\nPrice:\nN/A\nMerge the following:\nHigure\nx1\nKing Drago Insignia\nx20\nDarkon Insignia\nx20\nSellback:\n0 AC\nRarity:\nChampion Rarity\nBase Level:\n80\nBase Damage:\n30-30\nDescription:\n﻿It is impossible to run away from this black blade. I wonder if there is a more worthy hero to wield it?\nNotes:\nHigure (日暮れ) means\n\"Twilight\"\nin Japanese.\nWhen equipped, this item provides a 35% bonus to Class Points and Experience, 30% bonus to Gold and Reputation, and does 51% more damage to\nall monsters\n.\nThis item is a parody of\nYoru\nfrom\nOne Piece\n.\nAlso see:\nAstravian Buccaneer Coat and Blade (0 AC)\n.\nAstravian Buccaneer Coat and Blade (AC)\n.\nSheathed Higure (0 AC)\n.\nSheathed Higure (AC)\n.\nThanks to Moo.\nwindow['nitroAds'].createAd('wad-aqwwiki-below-content', {\n  \"refreshTime\": 30,\n  \"renderVisibleOnly\": false,\n  \"refreshVisibleOnly\": true,\n  \"sizes\": [ [ 300, 250 ] ],\n  \"report\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"wording\": \"Report Ad\",\n    \"position\": \"bottom-right\"\n  }\n  });\n0ac\n_e\nac\ncpboost\nfixed-dmg\nfreeplayer\ngoldboost\nioda-excl\nlv-locked\nmergereward\nparody\nrepboost\nshopitem\nsword\ntlapd\ntranslation\nxdmg2monsters\nxpboost",
